# Staged copies of a bundle laid out the way community-operators-prod wants it,
# assembled here so the tree can be read before it is copied into a fork. It is
# generated from dist/bundle and belongs in that repository, not in this one —
# committing it would be the second hand-written copy the generator exists to
# prevent.
